## SQ-WC-01 | watering can registers under hearthandharvest
@group A
@commands Boot; grep latest.log for `hearthandharvest`, `watering_can`, `Potentially Dangerous alternative prefix`
@pass at most the Forge alternative-prefix warning for `hearthandharvest:watering_can`; no error; recipe `creativeengineering:...watering_can` loaded (`/kubejs` recipe dump or JEI)
@fails registration under the foreign namespace refused, or NCH key missing
@from batches/r1031/a1_boot.qb
bootreject (?i)watering_can.*(error|exception)
look at most the Forge "Potentially Dangerous alternative prefix" warning for hearthandharvest:watering_can

## SQ-WC-02 | bonemeal substitutes tag
@group A
@commands `/execute if items` is 1.20; instead `/give <bot> minecraft:bone_meal 64` and check the tag: `/kubejs hand` not usable on a bot, so grep the tag dump (`/dumptags`) for `hearthandharvest:bonemeal_substitutes`
@pass the tag holds `minecraft:bone_meal`
@fails tag script not loaded
@from batches/r1031/a1_data.qb passed
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> cdevtest tag item hearthandharvest:bonemeal_substitutes
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=hearthandharvest:bonemeal_substitutes n=\d+ ids=\S*minecraft:bone_meal
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0

