expect FertilizerItem: "minecraft:bone_meal"
expect entity data: 61b
count verb=useair who=\S*qa\S* hand=main result= >= 3
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
> item replace entity qa weapon.offhand with minecraft:air

## CQ-WC-04 | watering can by hand (HNH-26, HNH-28, HNH-29)
@group client
@commands HNH-26, HNH-28, HNH-29 by hand: fill at water, charged use on a 3x3 of young wheat, campfire
@pass one use = water -1, fertilizer -1 (not -2), 3x3 grows; campfire unlit
@fails double application (client claim not working)
@from batches/r1101/c1_client.qb
> item replace entity @s hotbar.0 with hearthandharvest:watering_can
> item replace entity @s weapon.offhand with minecraft:bone_meal 64
> tp @s -40 -55 -32 180 20
sleep 3
> fill -40 -61 -40 -36 -61 -36 minecraft:farmland[moisture=7]
> fill -39 -60 -39 -37 -60 -37 minecraft:wheat[age=0]
> setblock -40 -60 -34 minecraft:water
> setblock -34 -60 -38 minecraft:campfire[lit=true]
look hand: fill the can at the water (-40 -60 -34); one charged use on the 3x3 wheat: water -1 and fertiliser -1 (not -2), the 3x3 grows; on the campfire: unlit, water -1

